# S Shield — self-audit checklist (not a formal third-party audit)

- [ ] SBX2 magic + version checked
- [ ] PBKDF2 iterations documented (200k)
- [ ] Dual HMAC verified on open
- [ ] Tamper / wrong key fail-closed
- [ ] .sbx.map never shipped in release
- [ ] S_SHIELD_KEY not in git
- [ ] SECURITY.md claims match behavior
- [ ] No "impossible RE" marketing

Formal external audit: schedule when budget / threat model requires it.
